{"id":"1b9a33135e67a903","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-elementary-equivalence.md","title":"Elementary Equivalence","display":"df-elementary-equivalence — Elementary Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-elementary-equivalence","aliases":["58-df-elementary-equivalence"],"display":"df-elementary-equivalence — Elementary Equivalence","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-elementary-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-elementary-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-equivalence — Elementary Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{(-)}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{(-)}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\\;\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\models\\;\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\to(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\to(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\equiv \\mathfrak{B}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\equiv \\mathfrak{B}\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{B}\">\\(\\mathfrak{B}\\)</span> satisfy exactly the same sentences.</li>\n<li>Elementary equivalence is coarser than isomorphism.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","lo